Third-party components
======================

The following components are used at runtime or compile time but are NOT bundled in this project's
jar. No source code from them has been copied into this project.

- Create
  https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create
  MIT License. Used at runtime as a required dependency.

- Create Railways Navigator (CRN)
  https://github.com/MisterJulsen/Create-Train-Navigator
  GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0. Hard runtime dependency; this mod calls its public addon
  API (dynamic linking only).

- DragonLib
  Required by Create Railways Navigator. See its own project for licensing.

- Xaero's World Map
  https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map
  Proprietary, closed-source. Integrated at runtime only, via mixins into its map screen; no code
  copied and no classes bundled.

- JourneyMap / JourneyMap API
  https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap
  JourneyMap is proprietary. Its official addon API is used at compile time only (and as an optional
  runtime soft dependency); no JourneyMap classes are bundled or copied.

- Steam 'n' Rails (SnR)
  https://github.com/Layers-of-Railways/Railway
  GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0. Optional runtime integration only: when SnR is installed,
  this mod looks up SnR's public schedule instruction id ("railways:waypoint_destination") through
  Create's instruction registry to build pass-through waypoint entries. No SnR classes are imported,
  bundled, or copied; if SnR is absent the feature falls back to normal stops.

- ComputerCraft / CC:Tweaked
  Compute API planned for a future integration. Not currently used.
